  "description": "Classic Low Step Cruiser with Pedal Assist and Throttle.\n48v14ah Battery In Frame 672wh Range: 25-55m 500W/1050w Dapu Motor Soft Start Pedal Assist Available in Lavender, Sea Foam and Blue Pearl\nBetter Parts = Better Ride, Less Maintenance\nEquipped with Avid Disc Brakes, 100mm adjustable Air Suspension, Shimano Alivio 8, and Quality Tires, Wheels. A longer-lasting, comfortable ride and confident handling comes from better parts.\nOn the Road and On the Trail Performance\nStrong, light 27.5inch wheels, with road and light trail ready tires, and a low profile in-frame battery under the rider giving you comfort and unmatched handling at cruising speed and around turns.\nPowerful Geared Motor with Smooth Assist\nThe Ease features a powerful Dapu 48v500w with up 1056 watts of motor output. Volton cadence assist is smooth and comfortable, with a refined soft-start control riders prefer over the jerky and jumpy assist from the competition.\nBattery Integrated Frame\nEnjoy a quality ride that is built to last - no plastic housing, or bulky frame and rack mountings are used on the Ease. Volton offers some of the best appointed low profile in frame electric bicycle designs since 2012.\nFun for the Family\nVolton is know for building bikes with power to share. Invite the kids, tow a trailer and pack some snacks - everyone loves a Volton Electric Bicycle ride!\nQuality Electronic Power Guaranteed\nOur packs feature all aluminum housing, that securely locks and can be charged installed or away from the frame. With over ten years of on the road performance, Volton's lightweight, high capacity battery packs, and chargers ensure a long lasting and reliable source of power.",
